Name: string_cache

    string_cache 0.8.7 (interned strings for markup5ever/xml5ever; patched for Fil-C: the dynamic-atom Entry pointer is kept as a real capability-carrying field, and the DYNAMIC_SET uses the pizlonated glibc pthread mutex instead of parking_lot)
